<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed index Jan  11.3 vs rvsd -6.2 Dec.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed index Jan  11.3 vs rvsd -6.2 Dec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia said on Thursday its diffusion index of business activity in the manufacturing sector rose to 11.3 in January from a revised -6.2 in December.</p>
<p>				Jan   Drop   Unch   Rise  Rvsd Dec</p>
<p>Business Conditions    11.3   16.1   55.4   27.4   - 6.2</p>
<p>New orders		 18.7   13.0   51.0   31.7   - 2.9</p>
<p>Shipments		   9.4   18.0   53.2   27.4     4.1</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 -12.7   23.2   60.4   10.6   -15.5</p>
<p>Delivery time	   -11.0   20.9   69.2    9.9   -13.4</p>
<p>Inventories		 3.4   25.4   45.8   28.8   - 6.6</p>
<p>Prices paid		 2.1    7.5   81.6    9.6    14.4</p>
<p>Prices received	 - 3.0    7.0   87.0    4.0     3.3</p>
<p>Number of employees     3.4   11.5   73.4   15.0   - 3.2</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660</p>
</text>
